      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Tacoma Eastern Railroad arrived in 1904, linking Eatonville to Tacoma and sparking rapid growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
