      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eatonville%2C_Washington",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town's newspaper, the Eatonville Dispatch, began in 1909 and chronicled local life for over a century.",
